<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4918"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Metalhead<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Metalhead<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 12:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->could it be possible that btk worked for the dmv and all the victims had been by to renew their drivers liscene shortly before their death?didnt those guys at dmv wear uniforms with badges which might explain how he gained access to some of the houses??its late and i have been reading too many posts!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
